"""Predict rare formatting and spelling cues, rather than ordinary prose.

Large positive pulses mark an initial Title: label, opening markup and
comment headers, traceback line labels, and git diff headers. Smaller
spelling rules recognize a nasal a and five/fif-like spellings.
Repeated middle dots and five-hash headings are negative. Unrecognized
text is zero. Only a short text suffix and document position are retained.
