"""Candidate 5: the spelling of "cloth" and "fabric" in English, and the Chinese/Japanese
character 布 (cloth). The program reads the letters typed so far in the document, so the
token that completes "cloth" in "Clo|th", "Lo|th" or "washclo|ths" counts, and a word that
merely contains "fabric", as in "prefabric", does not."""
READS = ()

# Whole English words (lowercase) -> typical activation.
